!! shows ~ a-record · the-card · one-bag · one-slot · the-whole-carrier · the-text-alone · the-whole-text · the-families · a-visit

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`a-record` params=`title/[[Room 4]] recipe/default ~ the record on its gradient, fat within a page; the base rides beside it`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`the-card` params=`title/[[Room 4]] recipe/default skinny/true ~ every field, the text left home`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`one-bag` params=`title/[[Room 4]] bag/lares ~ that one bag's record, its base and the bag that answered`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`one-slot` params=`title/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance recipe/lares meme/true slot/#/takes ~ one slot of a meme, its partial base beside it`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`the-whole-carrier` params=`title/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance recipe/lares meme/true all/true ~ the whole carrier, paged on slot boundaries and joined`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`the-text-alone` params=`title/[[Room 4]] recipe/default text/true ~ the text alone on stdout, ready for a pipe; the has line and base on stderr`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`the-whole-text` params=`title/[[Room 4]] recipe/default grain/whole ~ the record fat, its text at tiddler.fields.text`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`the-families` params=`recipe/default meme/true tree/true ~ the family roots this view holds, each with its slots`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`a-visit` params=`title/[[Sibling note]] recipe/default target/h1 ~ a lit sibling's daemon wiki, read while you keep your own face`>>
```

