!! takes ~ title · container · face · meme · grain · skinny · all · slot · text · fields · max-bytes · after · target · tree

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/container`>>
<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/face`>>

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`title` params=`takes/title seat/1 as/<title> ~ the record, any right-intent string, a lar: title whole; absent beside meme, the family listing`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`meme` params=`~ the carrier lens: a meme's root and slots recomposed into one sealed carrier; with no title, the family listing`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`grain` params=`takes/grain skins/mcp,console ~ skinny, fat, handle, resolved, slot or whole; none named, the door picks by size`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`skinny` params=`skins/cli ~ the card: every field, the text left home`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`all` params=`~ the whole at the lens's grain: a record fat, a pointer resolved, a meme's carrier followed page after page and joined`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`slot` params=`takes/slot-path ~ one slot of the meme the title names, as #/name`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`text` params=`skins/cli ~ the text alone on stdout, the has line and base on stderr`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`fields` params=`takes/names ~ the named fields alone`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`max-bytes` params=`takes/count ~ the byte cap on a record answer; the largest fields leave first, named under omitted`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`after` params=`takes/cursor ~ the page behind the cursor a prior answer named in next`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`target` params=`takes/face ~ another lit face this read visits, by handle index or pet name`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`tree` params=`~ with no title beside meme: nest each listed root's slots`>>
```

