!! gate ~ read

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`read` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ a read asks the face's read cap on the anchor's working bag; a record another bag answers stays out where the face holds no read on it, and withheld counts it`>>
```

