!! refuses ~ wiki-unreached · grain-unknown · text-unread · read-page-mismatch · cross-face-private · face-not-open

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`wiki-unreached` params=`cure/[[engine.record.reads title/<title> recipe/default]] ~ no wiki this face hosts or holds a share of answers the slug`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`grain-unknown` params=`cure/[[engine.record.reads title/<title> recipe/default grain/whole]] ~ a grain reads skinny, fat, handle, resolved, slot or whole`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`text-unread` params=`cure/[[engine.record.reads title/<title> recipe/default all/true]] ~ the answer carries no text, an unread pointer body or a card; the whole read carries it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`read-page-mismatch` params=`cure/[[engine.record.reads title/<title> recipe/default meme/true all/true]] ~ the whole carrier's pages failed validation; read again`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`cross-face-private` params=`~ a visit reads another face's canon and working layer alone; its personal and draft layers stay private`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-not-open` params=`~ the face named stands shut; a visit reads a lit face alone`>>
```

