!! answers ~ record · meme · families · not-found

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`record` params=`exit/0 fields/[[has recipe bag title lens tiddler grain next]] ~ the record on its gradient; tiddler names fields, hash, textHash, bag and position`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`meme` params=`exit/0 fields/[[has title lens meme grain next withheld]] ~ the carrier, whole within a page, its has-stack past it; canonicalHash rides as the base`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`families` params=`exit/0 fields/[[roots next]] ~ the family roots this view holds, a page at a time`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`not-found` params=`exit/3 ~ no record stands at the title in the reader's view`>>
```

